# www.btcnews.co.za Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in any necessary values

# API Configuration
# No API keys required - we use free public APIs:
# - CoinGecko API (free, no key needed)
# - Binance API (free public endpoints)
# - TradingView widgets (embedded)

# Database Configuration
# SQLite database stored in: /data/bitcoin.db
# Automatically stores price snapshots every 30 seconds
# Hourly prices stored for historical analysis
